Site data: estimates and margins of error from the U.S. Census Bureau,
American Community Survey (2024 5-year estimates), retrieved from
api.census.gov. Census Bureau data is in the public domain. ZIP-to-county
crosswalk: U.S. Census Bureau 2020 ZCTA-to-county relationship file.
